# A little round robot vacuum seen from the side: cream lid with a sensor dome, a blinking
# green LED, a coral bumper stripe, a side brush at the front. It cruises smoothly: step never
# bobs, only the brush turns. blink: LED off. quack: the LED flashes coral (a beep). hop: a bump.
name: mini-roomba
size: 16x16
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  D #3d405b
  B #5d6285
  G #81b29a
  g #3a5446
  R #e07a5f
  L #f4f1de
  l #d6d2bb

